            "verseId": "HOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 9.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ammo ato akasile taate, worri Israeli hore aka maansa baariini lafa ira dabra, ka nami dandae inhenne. Qara Waaqi, Isani nama kiyyaniti jed'eeni, ammo guyyaani ind'ufa, ka inni, Ilmaani Waaqa jiru jed'uuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gosa Yudatifi ta Israeli wolti deebisani takaa tolchani. Worri nama toko ka mata worraa tahe worraani deemu fohata, duuba worri ammalle hore daraara. D'uguma guyyaani Yezreeli guyya jaba taha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
